<title>USA: United Auto sees Q1 net below estimates.</title>
<headline>United Auto sees Q1 net below estimates.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Auto Group Inc said on Tuesday it expects net income per share for the first quarter to be in the range of $0.17 to $0.21, which would be below anaylsts' predictions of $0.25.</p>
<p>For full-year 1997, the company predicts net income per share in the $1.50 to $1.55 range, which would meet analysts' expectations, the company said.</p>
<p>United Auto said its 1996 pro forma earnings per share were $0.27 for the fourth quarter and $1.18 for the full year.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
